{"id":"2256709277","kind":"answer","title":"supermemo 为什么会出现难点管理？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2021-12-05","updated":"2021-12-05","votes":25,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":1025,"keywords":["间隔重复","知识表述","检索练习","最小信息原则","填空练习"],"summary":"「Anki是在又一次回答错误后，提示这张卡片加入记忆难点；而 supermemo 为什么在这张卡片显示之前会就出现难点管理？」 emmm，两个区别很大，但是重点不是回答错误前还是回答错误后。Anki 默认是 8 次错误加入记忆难点，然后自动暂停这张卡片。而 SuperMemo 则是 4 次错误后，会在你下一次看到这张卡片时，提…","question_detail_html":"<p>Anki是在又一次回答错误后，提示这张卡片加入记忆难点；而supermemo 为什么在这张卡片显示之前会就出现难点管理？</p><p>这样的意义是什么呢？ 而已应该如何在sm的难点管理中进行操作；以及如何处理这张卡片？</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-8c27c87e4d34f7ea7f2e088f0996e16e_r.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/></figure><p></p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/503736498/answer/2256709277","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"「Anki是在又一次回答错误后，提示这张卡片加入记忆难点；而 supermemo 为什么在这张卡片显示之前会就出现难点管理？」"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"这样的意义是什么呢？"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"如何在sm的难点管理中进行操作"},{"id":"sec-4","level":3,"title":"编辑"},{"id":"sec-5","level":3,"title":"忘记"},{"id":"sec-6","level":3,"title":"排除"},{"id":"sec-7","level":3,"title":"删除"},{"id":"sec-8","level":2,"title":"如何处理这张卡片？"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">「Anki是在又一次回答错误后，提示这张卡片加入记忆难点；而 supermemo 为什么在这张卡片显示之前会就出现难点管理？」</h2><p data-pid=\"E-sECg4e\">emmm，两个区别很大，但是重点不是回答错误前还是回答错误后。Anki 默认是 8 次错误加入记忆难点，然后自动暂停这张卡片。而 SuperMemo 则是 4 次错误后，会在你下一次看到这张卡片时，提醒你对这张卡片做出选择。</p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">这样的意义是什么呢？</h2><p data-pid=\"73ClHg7w\">记忆难点，就是你频繁遗忘的内容。针对这样的卡片，继续重复往往是浪费时间。</p><p data-pid=\"yCu0VnPM\">为什么？这些卡片都或多或少有以下特点：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"tdZLQhyw\">与现实缺乏有意义的联系</li><li data-pid=\"s3bsxQsZ\">和其他卡片内容相似，互相干扰</li><li data-pid=\"pt9W-PG-\">内容过于复杂，无法完全记住</li></ul><p data-pid=\"lGPEXBOD\">光靠重复，是无法记住这些内容的。如果尝试死记硬背，你可能付出代价：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"5ChpT472\">如果一个学生总是用一打困难的项目（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Leech\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆难点</a>）来填塞糟糕的记忆库，他会浪费很多时间在与自己的情感和记忆作斗争上。没有乐趣，毒性记忆<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>就会形成，对<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Pleasure_of_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习的热爱</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>就会被破坏。此外，还有一个机会成本，就是同一个学生可能会把同样的时间花在愉快的学习上，而不是试图敲打讨厌的记忆难点。他可能不会死记硬背<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>英语词汇，而会看一些英语电影。</blockquote><h2 id=\"sec-3\">如何在sm的难点管理中进行操作</h2><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2b243a44123801dbba6608c54c8efe95_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-be1c3cfcc813a46a00878aa159aa4ec0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-be1c3cfcc813a46a00878aa159aa4ec0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2b243a44123801dbba6608c54c8efe95_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-be1c3cfcc813a46a00878aa159aa4ec0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-be1c3cfcc813a46a00878aa159aa4ec0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"DBOAfbVP\">这幅图已经很显然了。你有四个选项：</p><ol><li data-pid=\"yYn1I_ZY\">编辑</li><li data-pid=\"uiTvbVz-\">忘记</li><li data-pid=\"J3atvcXx\">排除</li><li data-pid=\"ouz0K1ws\">删除</li></ol><p data-pid=\"CWfRFOrg\">下面详细说明</p><h3 id=\"sec-4\">编辑</h3><blockquote data-pid=\"odBAuEa_\">大多数情况下，记忆难点<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>来自对知识表述的 20 条规则<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>的不尊重。</blockquote><p data-pid=\"QpNeiNI1\">请对这张卡片进行修改，以符合知识表述的 20 条规则。这样才是从根本上解决问题。</p><h3 id=\"sec-5\">忘记</h3><p data-pid=\"DcUOYsaS\">将这张卡片重置为新卡片，放入等待队列<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>。在等待队列中的卡片，需要你进入学习新材料阶段才会加入你的复习过程。</p><h3 id=\"sec-6\">排除</h3><p data-pid=\"bZobSG2_\">类似于 Anki 中的暂停。以后不复习这张卡片了，但是内容会保留在 SuperMemo 中。</p><h3 id=\"sec-7\">删除</h3><p data-pid=\"dXT0XBwM\">再也不见！</p><h2 id=\"sec-8\">如何处理这张卡片？</h2><p data-pid=\"OG9NCyAE\">请参考以下文章：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5753541fed53c1aa73f9ce332a1ac5d0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"271\" data-image-width=\"732\" data-tm-id=\"52369009\" href=\"#/post/52369009\">叶峻峣：Anki高考的20条原则(1-5)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2a911033533550382335768d3296177a_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"813\" data-image-width=\"1920\" data-tm-id=\"297790034\" href=\"#/post/297790034\">叶峻峣：基于主动回忆的学习中的知识结构与表述</a><p></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 毒性记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67390960\" href=\"#/post/67390960\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 学习的乐趣 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1578551193\" href=\"#/post/1578551193\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 死记硬背（填鸭式学习） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"360416156\" href=\"#/post/360416156\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 难点卡片(Leech) <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"307602868\" href=\"#/post/307602868\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 20 条知识表述规则 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269997143\" href=\"#/post/269997143\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> Pending queue 等待队列 <a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/pending_queue\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yuque.com/supermemo/wiki/pending_queue</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"52369009","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(1-5)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":521,"minutes":7,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"269997143","title":"20 条知识表述规则（20 周年版）","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":251,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"67390960","title":"9 毒性记忆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":227,"minutes":24,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"297790034","title":"基于主动回忆的学习中的知识结构与表述","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":176,"minutes":42,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"360416156","title":"死记硬背（填鸭式学习）","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":1,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"52459340","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(6-10)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":187,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"53919249","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(11-15)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":131,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"54393154","title":"Anki高考的20条原则(16-20)—来自《有效的学习：组织知识的20条原则》","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":116,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"718778050","title":"间隔重复的有效实践","author":"Fernando Borretti","votes":286,"minutes":40,"reason":"延伸深读 · Fernando Borretti"},{"id":"691567753","title":"设计明晰 Anki 卡片的规则","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":255,"minutes":17,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2264896156","title":"如何有效进行背诵？","author"